<p>Every showroom has limited wall space for door samples, so the most useful trend data is the simplest: <strong>what are people actually ordering?</strong> W.W. Wood Products shared its <strong>February 2026 Top 10 finishes and Top 10 species</strong>, which we ran in the "Current Trends" section of our newsletter. Here they are, with what we'd do about them.</p>

